@EmployeeDemo.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5213
@jwt_token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@refresh_token = YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Weather Forecast
GET {{EmployeeDemo.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Register User
POST {{EmployeeDemo.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/register?role=USER
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

###

### Login (returns JWT with embedded deviceId and raw refreshToken)
POST {{EmployeeDemo.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

###

### Refresh Token (JWT contains device_id claim, no query param needed)
POST {{EmployeeDemo.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "{{jwt_token}}",
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

###

### Logout Current Device (deviceId extracted from JWT claims)
POST {{EmployeeDemo.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###

### Logout All Devices (deviceId extracted from JWT claims)
POST {{EmployeeDemo.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/logout-all-devices
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###
